{"conclusion":"误译：源串为 npcs.lua 天赋名 Dismay（t-engine4 commit 624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63，game/modules/tome/data/talents/misc/npcs.lua:3654-3665，psionic/other 被动，info 为 \"...have an %0.1f%% chance of becomi","disposition":"confirmed","entry_revision_identity":"9896e162e87f46511dc8d6fcb480745b937f0d901e17594de614ec3b5bf7e376","evidence_commit":null,"evidence_path":null,"evidence_snapshot":{"content":"误译：源串为 npcs.lua 天赋名 Dismay（t-engine4 commit 624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63，game/modules/tome/data/talents/misc/npcs.lua:3654-3665，psionic/other 被动，info 为 \"...have an %0.1f%% chance of becoming dismayed... the first melee attack against the foe will result in a critical hit\"，并由 Combat.lua:1105/1946 的 EFF_DISMAYED 实现），语义为「惊惶/沮丧」（同版本 locales/ja_JP.lua:27032 译「失意のどん底」、ko_KR.lua:26674 译「경악」）。译文「黑暗痛苦」既非 dismay 的语义，也与该天赋施加的 Dismayed 状态（保证下一次近战暴击）无任何名义关联，割断天赋名与状态名的对应关系。","sha256":"0e6a15aa627c46b54f414b41e96dc7e2d7779bf9ad655d0d7fdf65caf65ff257"},"observation_contract":"translation_contextual_v2","observation_identity":"6bedca53d940ac0d22189bf264abe63082dc58b620f0f39be26d05b9876fc2e9","observation_sha256":"0e6a15aa627c46b54f414b41e96dc7e2d7779bf9ad655d0d7fdf65caf65ff257","repair_required":true,"schema_version":1}
{"conclusion":"漏译：源串（同 commit，game/modules/tome/data/timed_effects/magical.lua:2059，位于 EFF IMPENDING_DOOM 的 on_timeout，每 3 回合为施法者 incSoul(1) 时 logSeen 输出）明确把灵魂被撕裂归因于 Impending Doom（同文件 2040 行 desc=\"Impending Doom\"，2","disposition":"confirmed","entry_revision_identity":"990dfc10cd2a2057049e662ed4323422a23efbaa419be3efa2912b3e45225446","evidence_commit":null,"evidence_path":null,"evidence_snapshot":{"content":"漏译：源串（同 commit，game/modules/tome/data/timed_effects/magical.lua:2059，位于 EFF IMPENDING_DOOM 的 on_timeout，每 3 回合为施法者 incSoul(1) 时 logSeen 输出）明确把灵魂被撕裂归因于 Impending Doom（同文件 2040 行 desc=\"Impending Doom\"，2046/2047 行状态标记 +Doomed/-Doomed）。译文「%s的灵魂被撕裂了一片！」删去 \"by Impending Doom\"，丢失了事件与该持续效果的归因关系，玩家无法从日志判断是哪个效果在生效并为施法者产出灵魂。","sha256":"b838a5560f7f35a462969a7c6b30813c19dcb7b75dce480f715fcbdbda1f4cba"},"observation_contract":"translation_contextual_v2","observation_identity":"0c6dc1d078da804acb0b8c7bb82369a3024b4a09737bdcdf439c89a9a3d8ef84","observation_sha256":"b838a5560f7f35a462969a7c6b30813c19dcb7b75dce480f715fcbdbda1f4cba","repair_required":true,"schema_version":1}
